  "implementationNotes": [
    "Rule-local u16 piece IDs retain 435 internal identities and indices through 1295.",
    "Bunju tn requires four hops; JSON v5 is separate from existing JSON v4.",
    "Type100 transit captures remove friendly and enemy intervening pieces, with reversible deltas.",
    "Finite jump limits count intervening occupied squares; mustBeEmpty prohibits duplicate destinations from other primitives too.",
    "Taikyoku alone checks for a legal stalemate reply before the same king/check precondition; 3 new core tests cover legal reply, no-reply loss, and no-reply checked play.",
